id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
31107::$$$message_0226_0000_0000$$$::...I'm pretty sure I don't have any plans.[lr]::
31108::$$$message_0226_0000_0001$$$::I lie down, splay out my arms and legs, and let the fatigue overcome my body.[lr]::
31109::$$$message_0226_0000_0002$$$::My mind sinks into the calming numbness of sleep.::
31110::$$$message_0226_0001_0000$$$::"Now, what to do tomorrow..."[lr]::
31111::$$$message_0226_0001_0001$$$::There's a lot to think about and do, but I can decide tomorrow.[lr]::
31112::$$$message_0226_0001_0002$$$::For now, I commend myself on a good day's work...[lr]::

